{"time": 1763168147, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2110092977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "开始记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1763168307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994140645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "密歇根州的阿诺兹堡是一个偏僻小城镇，世界上其他地方的人甚至不一定能知道这样一个地方"}
{"time": 1763168375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596668781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "就是这个小地方也是麻雀虽小，五脏俱全——这种小地方甚至有自己的警察局，图书馆，乃至报社！"}
{"time": 1763168497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096517184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "在阿诺兹堡市的边缘，有一片墓地，墓地周围是片树林，附近还有几栋民居，而其中离墓地最近的一户就是金博尔家"}
{"time": 1763168593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1362917560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "深秋的某日，这个罕有生人的地方迎来了一位陌生的访客"}
{"time": 1763168672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604406686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "（可以行动了。）"}
{"time": 1763168790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230422716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "“偏僻到家的城镇搭上偏僻到家的地点，不知我放弃休假接下这个委托的决定是否正确……不过报酬确实可观，如果是为了下一个月的生活费，倒也不虚此行。”我边走边观察宅邸的四周环境。"}
{"time": 1763168810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704131049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "（我过一个侦查可以吗）"}
{"time": 1763168819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1941994068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "（不用）"}
{"time": 1763168825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051636693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "（行）"}
{"time": 1763168888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "270044884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "离墓地最近的一栋民房，不过离其他民房也就五分钟脚程"}
{"time": 1763168964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523166682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "可以看到墓地周围的树林以及墓地那扇上了锁的大铁栅门"}
{"time": 1763169090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1892384752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "（。）"}
{"time": 1763169121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1129943146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "我上前去敲金博尔家的门"}
{"time": 1763169262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2019122585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“来了，您稍等”里面传来了一个男声，不久门开了，一名中年男子站在门后，这就是你此行的雇主，托马斯金博尔了，“你好，您就是来接受委托的吧，欢迎欢迎，先进来坐坐吧”"}
{"time": 1763169421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1343579408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "“打扰了。”跟着金博尔进屋。边走边问他 “我们开门见山地解决问题吧。您可以和我详细说说您遇到的困扰吗？”"}
{"time": 1763169659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886320780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“事情是这样的，去年我叔叔道格拉斯失踪了，我被通知来继承了这栋房子。近几天打扫的时候，我发现，他书房里留下的书被偷了几本。您知道的先生，警察不会为了区区几本书大费周章，我只好发布了这样的委托来帮我找偷书贼，毕竟这也算我叔叔的遗物了”"}
{"time": 1763169681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1220308149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "你们坐定后，托马斯翻出一张照片"}
{"time": 1763169728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "960430312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“这就是我叔叔的照片，如果你能找到关于他行踪的线索那就更好了”"}
{"time": 1763169750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394424579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“我愿意为了这份委托支付10美元”"}
{"time": 1763169763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "55365356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“先生您意下如何？”"}
{"time": 1763169908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "88089089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "10美元，减去来这里的交通费用，省吃俭用的话倒勉强可用两个星期了。再说来这里的车费给都给了……“当然，我很乐意”看向托马斯给出的照片。"}
{"time": 1763169930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1135347713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "（这照片有特殊的地方吗，要不要过个侦查啥的"}
{"time": 1763169931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "458798127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=88089089]（1920年代的10刀相当于现在的数百刀）"}
{"time": 1763169951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "268764592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "（卧槽我乱写的，果咩那塞）"}
{"time": 1763169958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151595321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "（不少了）"}
{"time": 1763169984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821766005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "（就当过去的交通费很贵（也贵不到哪去。））"}
{"time": 1763170019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1169123390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "照片上面是个秃顶，白发，戴圆框眼镜，中等身材的老年男人"}
{"time": 1763170058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062292471", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=2A0EED13A415A899831ED64D7EB31A37.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTIA1zAVjvQAVlsEQmrGQ8u508fuRjt_gIg_woog5Xfp4DzkAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ41_iJvN_TdyDApxUHiW0BHoC5tOCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMCBtzAeoTQym4200J7O3SFDHfWFDz3zmDF2Pg-KyYYrg5Drgb_S3eKNng-KNaE0tMA,file_size=49005]"}
{"time": 1763170062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745127280", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "形象参考"}
{"time": 1763170115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "615564533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "“我可以问问去年您叔叔失踪的详细情况吗？”"}
{"time": 1763170309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051434324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“我叔叔性格古怪，平时爱好只有读书，不跟别人来往 连我这样的亲人也不太了解，当时我还是被通知来继承房子的时候才知道他失踪这件事。我当时在镇上到处张贴了寻人启事，警察也出动过在镇子周围搜索过一番，没有找到什么别的线索，也就没有下文了”"}
{"time": 1763170466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2121094027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "“我了解了。那些书失窃时，您的房子里可有怪事发生？”"}
{"time": 1763170530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748328905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“没有，我打扫房间的时候才发现的，要不您一会儿先去书房看看？”"}
{"time": 1763170567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1595376514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "我起身“现在就去看看吧。”"}
{"time": 1763170600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1004137938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“对了，您在镇子上有落脚的地方吗”"}
{"time": 1763170699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737225730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "我愣一下，想了想确实没特别考虑这事，本想随便遇到个旅馆下榻便完了“呃…并没有特别安排。”"}
{"time": 1763170809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364160444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“想必调查不是一两天内就能完成的，不嫌弃的话就在我家客房住下吧，您想在我家用早晚餐的话提前说一声就好”"}
{"time": 1763170927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "935991898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "“啊，非常感谢。那么麻烦您了，关于调查的事，我一定尽力相助。”"}
{"time": 1763171033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "37960768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "交流完，托马斯带你来到了书房，然后对你说“您可以在这找找有没有什么关于偷书贼的线索，我还有事忙，先不陪你了”"}
{"time": 1763171087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "437335949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "我向他微微一点头，然后打量周围"}
{"time": 1763171195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "423966782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "书房里被巨大的书架环绕着，密密麻麻摆了许多藏书，可以看出来被主人好好保养着，不过中间有几个明显的空隙，大概就是被偷走的那几本书原本的位置，书房的窗户往外看正好能看到墓地的大铁栅门"}
{"time": 1763171214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "505001889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "可以过个侦查"}
