{"time": 1763171370, "type": "reply", "message_id": "366730625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[内华达_琼斯]演奏出: 1D100=11"}
