{"time": 1763174449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1795678538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "自己调查既然毫无进展，那便从别人身上找找有没有突破口吧。我来到金博尔家周围民居的其中一个，敲门问有没有人在。"}
{"time": 1763174520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261229412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“干什么的？”里面的人问"}
{"time": 1763174702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2022139965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "我欠身行礼“不好意思叨扰了，我受隔壁金博尔家之托，调查他们家的一宗失窃案。想来找您了解一下情况，不知您现在方便吗？”"}
{"time": 1763174720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "694128595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“哦，您想了解什么”"}
{"time": 1763174759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "423059135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "门打开了，里面穿着围裙的主妇问"}
{"time": 1763174930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "399686339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "“金博尔家的前主人在去年失踪。您作为他的邻居，对老金博尔有没有什么了解？失踪时这一片有没有什么异变呢？”"}
{"time": 1763175021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1626784158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“老金博尔看起来是个怪老头，实际上对人还是很温和的，大伙都知道他晚上会到墓地里读书，不过怪事的话我想想”"}
{"time": 1763175025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182514245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "。rh"}
