{"time": 1763175056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250330640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "“没听说，要不您问问别人”"}
{"time": 1763175200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1065968287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "“很感谢您的帮助。”再度碰壁，我有些失落地离开，决定干脆直接借鉴别人的调查成果。然后我动身去警察局吧"}
